    rdfs:comment "Contains review target classes, BioPortal ancestors, direct superclass edges, and common annotations only. Full source OWL axioms are not preserved." .

<https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/BiologicalEntity> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A heterogeneous substance that contains genomic material or is the product of a biological process." .
<https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/BiologicalEntity> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/BiologicalEntity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "biological entity" .
<https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/BiologicalEntity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/NamedThing> .
<https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/BiologicalEntity> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "bioentity" .
<https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/BiologicalProcess> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "One or more causally connected executions of molecular functions" .
<https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/BiologicalProcess> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/BiologicalProcess> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "biological process" .
<https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/BiologicalProcess> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/BiologicalProcessOrActivity> .
<https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/BiologicalProcessOrActivity> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "Either an individual molecular activity, or a collection of causally connected molecular activities in a biological system." .
<https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/BiologicalProcessOrActivity> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/BiologicalProcessOrActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "biological process or activity" .
<https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/BiologicalProcessOrActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/BiologicalEntity> .
<https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/Disease> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A disease is a disposition to undergo pathological processes that exists in an organism because of one or more disorders in that organism. A disorder of structure or function, especially one that produces specific signs, phenotypes or symptoms or that affects a specific location and is not simply a direct result of physical injury." .
<https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/Disease> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "review target in BIOLINK from disease_terms_review_enriched.csv" .
<https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/Disease> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/Disease> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "disease" .
