<https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/DiseaseOrPhenotypicFeature> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A disease or an individual phenotypic feature, grouped as a single class to accommodate source vocabularies and assertions that do not distinguish the two. Prefer the more specific subclasses disease or phenotypic feature when the distinction is known." .
<https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/DiseaseOrPhenotypicFeature> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/DiseaseOrPhenotypicFeature> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "disease or phenotypic feature" .
<https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/DiseaseOrPhenotypicFeature> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/BiologicalEntity> .
<https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/DiseaseOrPhenotypicFeature> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "phenome" .
